 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "Explore a Lagoon 82 catamaran, from its impressive hydraulic swim platform to its expansive master cabin. The tour showcases the yacht's luxurious interior, including a spacious saloon and multiple dining areas. Discover a unique crew area and sustainable materials used in its construction.",
   "source": "YACHTING WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "This new flagship from Lagoon represents a significant step forward from the successful Seventy 7, blending technical innovation, elegant design, and versatility for owners seeking the ultimate luxury on the sea.",
   "source": "Katamarans"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Lagoon has unveiled its latest masterpiece, the Eighty 2 catamaran at Cannes Yachting Festival. The announcement comes alongside the premiere of two other models and the launch of an innovative pre-owned yacht programme named Neo.",
   "source": "YachtStyle"
  },
  {
   "quote": "With the EIGHTY 2, Lagoon reaffirms its commitment to innovation in the world of luxury yachting. This new iconic yacht embodies a sustainable, innovative and timeless vision of modern sailing.",
   "source": "Voile & Moteur"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The latest creation from Lagoon shipyard, the Eighty 2 is the flagship of the catamaran builder's fleet. A true yacht, it offers simply unparalleled living space on board and impressive sailing performance.",
   "source": "Figaro Nautisme"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The layout of the first model sees three other guest cabins and a lower galley connecting to crew quarters. This is a yacht for many guests, friends and family to enjoy – you just need to choose from where best to do so. The beam-wide saloon looks formidable, and links through to a forward cockpit for up to eight.",
   "source": "YACHTING WORLD"
  }
 ]
